{"unit_id":"AsterLuo__dsh-buddy-guard#card-zh","repo":"AsterLuo/dsh-buddy-guard","commit":"86af94f42938cd1e9d018157de2469826affdf0c","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-buddy-guard 是面向 DSH buddy 渠道的提示词兼容插件。它在 system-prompt/assemble 阶段处理系统提示词，为配置的 provider 改写身份句并替换路径指纹短语；支持启停、provider 列表和可选诊断日志。适合使用 buddy 渠道并遇到请求失败的 DSH 用户；安装后需重启，旧会话中的消息不会被改写。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:191-224"]}
{"unit_id":"AsterLuo__dsh-buddy-guard#card-en","repo":"AsterLuo/dsh-buddy-guard","commit":"86af94f42938cd1e9d018157de2469826affdf0c","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-buddy-guard adjusts system prompts for DSH’s buddy channel. During system-prompt/assemble, it rewrites an identity sentence and path phrase in selected prompt sections. It supports provider selection and optional diagnostic logs. Restart after installation; existing session history is unchanged.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:191-224"]}
