{"unit_id":"AsterLuo__dsh-buddy-guard#feature-1","repo":"AsterLuo/dsh-buddy-guard","commit":"86af94f42938cd1e9d018157de2469826affdf0c","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-buddy-guard 的功能「身份句改写」：对目标 provider 的 system prompt section，识别开头身份句并插入逗号改写；可处理前导空白，已改写文本保持不变。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:125"]}
{"unit_id":"AsterLuo__dsh-buddy-guard#feature-2","repo":"AsterLuo/dsh-buddy-guard","commit":"86af94f42938cd1e9d018157de2469826affdf0c","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-buddy-guard 的功能「路径短语改写」：扫描目标 provider 的全部提示词 section，将指定的 @ 路径描述替换为等价句子，避免只处理首个 section。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:110"]}
{"unit_id":"AsterLuo__dsh-buddy-guard#feature-3","repo":"AsterLuo/dsh-buddy-guard","commit":"86af94f42938cd1e9d018157de2469826affdf0c","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-buddy-guard 的功能「Provider 选择」：从 assembly variables 或 agent options 读取 provider；默认只启用 buddy，也可通过配置 providers 指定名单。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:98"]}
{"unit_id":"AsterLuo__dsh-buddy-guard#feature-4","repo":"AsterLuo/dsh-buddy-guard","commit":"86af94f42938cd1e9d018157de2469826affdf0c","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-buddy-guard 的功能「诊断日志」：开启 debug 后，将命中或异常信息追加到 DSH_HOME 下的 buddy-guard.log；写日志失败不会中断提示词组装。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:173"]}
{"unit_id":"AsterLuo__dsh-buddy-guard#caveat-1","repo":"AsterLuo/dsh-buddy-guard","commit":"86af94f42938cd1e9d018157de2469826affdf0c","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-buddy-guard 只处理本轮组装的系统提示词；已经写入会话历史的消息不会被此插件改写，需在新会话中验证效果。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:148-165"]}
